 a user\u2019s technological habits, and use that to form a profile of the user of some sort. I used a packet-monitoring service to listen in on third-party applications and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":1812.8000000000002,"global_rank":405697},{"name":"manuelreneduran/sensitivity-analysis-google-scripts","owner":"manuelreneduran","html_url":"https://github.com/manuelreneduran/sensitivity-analysis-google-scripts","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":1812.8000000000002,"global_rank":405698},{"name":"LucasL53/ios_homekit","owner":"LucasL53","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasL53/ios_homekit","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":1812.8000000000002,"global_rank":405699},{"name":"joyfullyx/hello-world","owner":"joyfullyx","html_url":"https://github.com/joyfullyx/hello-world","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"new repository","topics":[],"score":1812.8000000000002,"global_rank":405700},{"name":"jhulten/notebooks","owner":"jhulten","html_url":"https://github.com/jhulten/notebooks","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":1812.8000000000002,"global_rank":405701},{"name":"ozharb/DSA-Stack-and-Queue","owner":"ozharb","html_url":"https://github.com/ozharb/DSA-Stack-and-Queue","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":1812.8000000000002,"global_rank":405702},{"name":"jason-roundtree/color_swatch","owner":"jason-roundtree","html_url":"https://github.com/jason-roundtree/color_swatch","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"l